From 48539b679f0774ed3e3c7857fe0faecda4c03ae2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sardi-dev <134648583+sardi-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:47:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/25] Move auction listing and bidding into AuctionHouseMgr

The sell and bid handlers held all the logic, so nothing without a client
could list an item or place a bid. Add ListItem for whole stacks and
PlaceBid, both returning a result instead of sending packets, plus
CreateAuction and CanAuctionItem shared with the handlers. Add
GetListings to copy the facts of an auction house into a vector, and a
small header with the duration, minimum bid and bid cost rules, covered
by game_domain_tests. Packets the client sees stay the same.
